[COMMENTS]
STATION,Velocity-area station with natural control. GENERAL: Velocity-area station. Station originally located in masonry building on right bank moved directly across channel to left bank in 2011. Current station comprised of steel container with main and backup instruments both using pressure probes. Channel width at station c.18m. STATION HYDROMETRY: Control at old bridge downstream. Channel has changed at the station over the years due to channel works and new bridge upstream. There is probably no better site on the river for the station. Multiple ratings applied to period of record. Rating derived from current meter gaugings. Simple extrapolation used above approx 3.5m. FLOW RECORD: Exceptionally low flows in May/June 2008; however high degree of uncertainty (recession pattern not observed upstream). Flows from 1975 onwards reprocessed in 2002. There is a lack of data July to August 2010 due to vandalism at the site. Full period of record peak flow data reviewed and released in August 2021 (WINFAP Files v10) and in August 2025 (WINFAP Files v14). FLOW REGIME: The net effect of industrial abstractions and effluent returns is minor.
CATCHMENT,Solid geology - the area is underlain predominantly by Palaeogene basalt lava flows. Drift geology - extensive glacial till with sand and gravel concentrated around Six Mile Water valley. Lacustrine deposits might be present below river alluvium. Limited rock near surface and post-glacial peat cover on high ground with restricted development of river alluvium in valleys. Significant proportion of upland - predominantly grassland or heath, limited afforestation. Urban area: Antrim has substantial light industry and Ballyclare is a small market town.
Qmed Suitability,Highest gauged flow at 1.3 x QMED. Rating fits high flow gaugings very well.
Pooling Suitability,High flows are not fully contained but floodplain flow not considered significant. Good number of gaugings in and around QMED extrapolation above this deemed acceptable to allow station to be classed as Suitable for Pooling.
[END]
